# Deny everything, then re-admit only what the Dockerfile COPYs. See the
# .dockerignore one directory up for why this is an allowlist.
#
# `!*.sh` mirrors the Dockerfile's `COPY *.sh` glob, so a new backup script
# still ships automatically — but the glob now has an explicit boundary
# rather than picking up whatever happens to be in this directory.

*

!*.sh
!crontab.template
